OL,3,GNEWSANo cost of living payment for NI
OL,4,Auntil Stormont budget agreed, says SoS
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Secretary of State has warned that
OL,7,Fa cost of living payment cannot be made
OL,8,Fin Northern Ireland until an Executive
OL,9,Fbudget is agreed.
OL,11,FIt comes after the Chancellor John
OL,12,FHealey announced the payment for
OL,13,Fhouseholds in England, based on how
OL,14,Fmuch council tax they pay.
OL,16,FDelivering his first Budget Healey said
OL,17,Fmoney will be made available to
OL,18,FStormont to fund an equivalent scheme.
OL,20,FHowever Chris Bryant said that Stormont
OL,21,Fwill not be in a legal position to
OL,22,Fdeliver the money without a budget.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
